### Health check

GET http://localhost:8080/api/health


### Upload image

POST http://localhost:8080/api/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< D:\project\image2playlist\test.png
--boundary--

### OCR test
### Use imageId from the upload response
POST http://localhost:8080/api/images/{{imageId}}/ocr

### Process image into an Apple Music review session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/images/{{imageId}}/process

### Load a review session
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Create playlist after selecting one or more matches
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/playlist
Content-Type: application/json
Music-User-Token: {{musicUserToken}}

{
  "playlistName": "Image2Playlist Mix",
  "description": "Created from an image with Image2Playlist"
}
